// Per-zone grass art direction. What GROWS is the map data's decision
// (ground effects, alpha weights, the no-grow masks); this file only decides
// what it looks like there. See include/pipeline/grass_biomes.hpp.
//
// Matching: "areas" matches a chunk's AreaTable id directly (subzones) and
// wins over "zones", which matches after walking AreaTable parentage up to
// the zone. First matching entry wins, so put specific rows first.
//
// Fields: heightScale / widthScale / densityScale MULTIPLY the profile the
// effect data derived (densityScale 0 = no grass at all). Everything else
// REPLACES: rootColor / tipColor ([r,g,b] 0-1; still blended toward the
// ground texture's own tones by the shader), colorVariation, stiffness,
// bloomChance, seedChance, and the two-anchor palettes bloomColorA/B (each
// blade's flower blends between them) and headColorA/B (seed head range).
